{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383430/extras/STEAM_EmeraldCoast_Description_image_616x257.png?t=1731925866\" /><br>Welcome to Australia! Discover breathtaking landscapes and hunt iconic animal species such as the Saltwater Crocodile and Eastern Gray Kangaroo as you explore this magical new hunting destination down under.<br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><br>\u2022 Explore the Australian outback, subtropical bushlands, and tropical rainforests, and experience the natural wonder of its stunning wilderness. <br>\u2022 Hunt some of Australia's most iconic fauna, including the Magpie Goose, Banteng, Saltwater Crocodile, Eastern Gray Kangaroo, and a new Great One.<br>\u2022 Make new friends and work together to protect the region's beautiful but fragile ecosystem through side and story missions focused on conservation, cooperation, and community.<br>\u2022 Expand your hunting arsenal with the new Zagan Varminter .22-250 Bolt-Action Rifle. Light and comfortable to shoot, it's the perfect companion for any hunting trip.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383430/extras/Emerald_Coast_Weapon_Description_image_02_616x257_copy.png?t=1731925866\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2383430?t=1731925866","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2383430?t=1731925866","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1731925866","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1731925866","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"St